  "details": "I know that there will be no further updates to SDK2 but just in case it is possible to add a quick legacy fix to prevent breaking a lot of old driving worlds I am reporting that you can no longer drive SDK2 car vehicles in VR since the new input update. You can still drive them using WASD on the keyboard though.\n\nYou can test this in any SDK 2 driving world such as my old Ridge Racer world:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/content/worlds/wrld_d22a0013-b93e-4415-b060-bb6f8511bcba/edit",
